\v 4 [And it shall be, when he lieth down]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [that thou shalt mark]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the place| strong="H4725" \w* [where he shall lie]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and thou shalt go in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}, [and uncover]{strong=“H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w his feet| strong="H4772" \w*, [and lay thee down]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; [and he will tell]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [thee what thou shalt do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}.\f + \fr 3:4 \ft uncover: or, lift up the clothes that are on \f* 
\v 5 [And she said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto her, All that thou sayest]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto me I will do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\p
\v 6 [And she went down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the floor| strong="H1637" \w*, [and did]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w according to all that her mother in law| strong="H2545" \w* [bade]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} her. 
