\p
\v 8 [And it came to pass at midnight]{strong=“H3915 H2677”}, \w that the man| strong="H376" \w* [was afraid]{strong=“H2729” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and turned]{strong=“H3943” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} [himself: and, behold, a woman]{strong=“H802”} [lay]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w at his feet| strong="H4772" \w*.\f + \fr 3:8 \ft turned: or, took hold on \f* 
\v 9 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, Who art [thou? And she answered]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, I am \w Ruth| strong="H7327" \w* \w thine handmaid| strong="H519" \w*: [spread]{strong=“H6566” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w therefore thy skirt| strong="H3671" \w* \w over thine handmaid| strong="H519" \w*; for thou art [a near kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}.\f + \fr 3:9 \ft a near…: or, one that hath right to redeem \f* 
\v 10 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Blessed]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} be thou of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w my daughter| strong="H1323" \w*: for [thou hast shewed]{strong=“H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w more kindness| strong="H2617" \w* \w in the latter end| strong="H314" \w* \w than at the beginning| strong="H7223" \w*, [inasmuch as thou followedst]{strong=“H310 H3212” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w not| strong="H1115" \w* \w young men| strong="H970" \w*, \w whether poor| strong="H1800" \w* \w or rich| strong="H6223" \w*. 
\v 11 [And now, my daughter]{strong=“H1323”}, [fear]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [not; I will do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to thee all that thou requirest]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: \w for all the city| strong="H8179" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w* [doth know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} that thou art \w a virtuous| strong="H2428" \w* \w woman| strong="H802" \w*.\f + \fr 3:11 \ft city: Heb. gate \f* 
\v 12 \w And now it is true| strong="H551" \w* that I am thy [near kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: \w howbeit there is| strong="H3426" \w* [a kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w nearer| strong="H7138" \w* than I. 
\v 13 [Tarry]{strong=“H3885” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w this night| strong="H3915" \w*, \w and it shall be in the morning| strong="H1242" \w*, that [if he will perform unto thee the part of a kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w well| strong="H2896" \w*; [let him do the kinsman’s part]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: [but if he will]{strong=“H2654” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [not do the part of a kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [to thee, then will I do the part of a kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} to thee, as the \sc Lord\sc* \w liveth| strong="H2416" \w*: [lie down]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w until the morning| strong="H1242" \w*. 
\p
\v 14 [And she lay]{strong=“H7901” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w at his feet| strong="H4772" \w* \w until the morning| strong="H1242" \w*: [and she rose up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w before| strong="H2958" \w* \w one| strong="H376" \w* [could know]{strong=“H5234” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w another| strong="H7453" \w*. [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Let it not be known]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w that a woman| strong="H802" \w* [came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w into the floor| strong="H1637" \w*. 
\v 15 [Also he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Bring]{strong=“H3051” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w the vail| strong="H4304" \w* that thou hast [upon thee, and hold]{strong=“H270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [it. And when she held]{strong=“H270” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [it, he measured]{strong=“H4058” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w six| strong="H8337" \w* measures \w of barley| strong="H8184" \w*, [and laid]{strong=“H7896” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it [on her: and she went]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w into the city| strong="H5892" \w*.\f + \fr 3:15 \ft vail: or, sheet, or, apron \f* 
\v 16 [And when she came]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to her mother in law| strong="H2545" \w*, [she said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, Who art [thou, my daughter]{strong=“H1323”}? [And she told]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w her all that the man| strong="H376" \w* [had done]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} to her. 
\v 17 [And she said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w These six| strong="H8337" \w* measures \w of barley| strong="H8184" \w* [gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [he me; for he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to me, Go]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w not empty| strong="H7387" \w* \w unto thy mother in law| strong="H2545" \w*. 
\v 18 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [she, Sit still]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, \w my daughter| strong="H1323" \w*, [until thou know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w how the matter| strong="H1697" \w* [will fall]{strong=“H5307” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: \w for the man| strong="H376" \w* [will not be in rest]{strong=“H8252” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w until| strong="H518" \w* [he have finished]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} \w the thing| strong="H1697" \w* \w this day| strong="H3117" \w*.
\c 4
\p 
\v 1 \w Then went| strong="H5927" \w* \w Boaz| strong="H1162" \w* [up]{strong=“H5927” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to the gate| strong="H8179" \w*, [and sat him down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [there: and, behold, the kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w of whom Boaz| strong="H1162" \w* [spake ]{strong=“H1696” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [came]{strong=“H5674” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [by; unto whom he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Ho| strong="H1945" \w*, \w such| strong="H6423" \w* \w a one| strong="H492" \w*! [turn aside]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [sit down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [here. And he turned aside]{strong=“H5493” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and sat down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 2 [And he took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w ten| strong="H6235" \w* \w men| strong="H582" \w* \w of the elders| strong="H2205" \w* \w of the city| strong="H5892" \w*, [and said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Sit ye down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [here. And they sat down]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}. 
\v 3 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto the kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w Naomi| strong="H5281" \w*, [that is come again]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w out of the country| strong="H7704" \w* \w of Moab| strong="H4124" \w*, [selleth]{strong=“H4376” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w a parcel| strong="H2513" \w* \w of land| strong="H7704" \w*, which was \w our brother| strong="H251" \w* [Elimelech’s]{strong=“H458”}: 
\v 4 [And I thought]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [to advertise]{strong=“H241 H1540” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thee, saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Buy]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} it [before the inhabitants]{strong=“H3427” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w and before the elders| strong="H2205" \w* \w of my people| strong="H5971" \w*. [If thou wilt redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it, [redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} it: [but if thou wilt not redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it, then [tell]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8685”} [me, that I may know]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}: for there is [none to redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it \w beside| strong="H2108" \w* thee; and I am \w after| strong="H310" \w* [thee. And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I will redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it.\f + \fr 4:4 \ft I thought…: Heb. I said, I will reveal in thine ear \f* 
\v 5 [Then said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Boaz| strong="H1162" \w*, \w What day| strong="H3117" \w* [thou buyest]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the field| strong="H7704" \w* \w of the hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w of Naomi| strong="H5281" \w*, [thou must buy]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it \w also of Ruth| strong="H7327" \w* \w the Moabitess| strong="H4125" \w*, \w the wife| strong="H802" \w* [of the dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”}, [to raise up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w the name| strong="H8034" \w* [of the dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w upon his inheritance| strong="H5159" \w*. 
\p
\v 6 [And the kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [I cannot]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it [for myself, lest I mar]{strong=“H7843” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w mine own inheritance| strong="H5159" \w*: [redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thou my right| strong="H1353" \w* [to thyself; for I cannot]{strong=“H3201” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [redeem]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} it. 
\v 7 Now this was the manner \w in former time| strong="H6440" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w* \w concerning redeeming| strong="H1353" \w* \w and concerning changing| strong="H8545" \w*, [for to confirm]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8763”} \w all things| strong="H1697" \w*; \w a man| strong="H376" \w* [plucked off]{strong=“H8025” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w his shoe| strong="H5275" \w*, [and gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} it \w to his neighbour| strong="H7453" \w*: and this was \w a testimony| strong="H8584" \w* \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*. 
\v 8 [Therefore the kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Boaz| strong="H1162" \w*, [Buy]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} it [for thee. So he drew off]{strong=“H8025” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his shoe| strong="H5275" \w*. 
\p
\v 9 \w And Boaz| strong="H1162" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto the elders| strong="H2205" \w*, and unto \w all the people| strong="H5971" \w*, Ye are \w witnesses| strong="H5707" \w* \w this day| strong="H3117" \w*, [that I have bought]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} all that was [Elimelech’s]{strong=“H458”}, and all that was [Chilion’s]{strong=“H3630”} [and Mahlon’s]{strong=“H4248”}, \w of the hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w of Naomi| strong="H5281" \w*. 
\v 10 \w Moreover Ruth| strong="H7327" \w* \w the Moabitess| strong="H4125" \w*, \w the wife| strong="H802" \w* \w of Mahlon| strong="H4248" \w*, [have I purchased]{strong=“H7069” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w to be my wife| strong="H802" \w*, [to raise up]{strong=“H6965” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8687”} \w the name| strong="H8034" \w* [of the dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} \w upon his inheritance| strong="H5159" \w*, \w that the name| strong="H8034" \w* [of the dead]{strong=“H4191” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8801”} [be not cut off]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w from among| strong="H5973" \w* \w his brethren| strong="H251" \w*, \w and from the gate| strong="H8179" \w* \w of his place| strong="H4725" \w*: ye are \w witnesses| strong="H5707" \w* \w this day| strong="H3117" \w*. 
\v 11 \w And all the people| strong="H5971" \w* that were \w in the gate| strong="H8179" \w*, \w and the elders| strong="H2205" \w*, [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, We are \w witnesses| strong="H5707" \w*. The \sc Lord\sc* [make]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the woman| strong="H802" \w* [that is come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w into thine house| strong="H1004" \w* \w like Rachel| strong="H7354" \w* \w and like Leah| strong="H3812" \w*, \w which two| strong="H8147" \w* [did build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Israel| strong="H3478" \w*: [and do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w thou worthily| strong="H2428" \w* \w in Ephratah| strong="H672" \w*, [and be famous]{strong=“H8034 H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [in Beth-lehem]{strong=“H1035”}:\f + \fr 4:11 \ft do thou…: or, get thee riches, or, power \f* \f + \fr 4:11 \ft be famous: Heb. proclaim thy name \f* 
\v 12 \w And let thy house| strong="H1004" \w* \w be like the house| strong="H1004" \w* \w of Pharez| strong="H6557" \w*, \w whom Tamar| strong="H8559" \w* [bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto Judah| strong="H3063" \w*, \w of the seed| strong="H2233" \w* which the \sc Lord\sc* [shall give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w thee of this young woman| strong="H5291" \w*. 
\p
\v 13 \w So Boaz| strong="H1162" \w* [took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w Ruth| strong="H7327" \w*, \w and she was his wife| strong="H802" \w*: [and when he went in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto her, the \sc Lord\sc* [gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w her conception| strong="H2032" \w*, [and she bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a son| strong="H1121" \w*. 
\v 14 \w And the women| strong="H802" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Naomi| strong="H5281" \w*, [Blessed]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8803”} be the \sc Lord\sc*, [which hath not left]{strong=“H7673” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w thee this day| strong="H3117" \w* [without a kinsman]{strong=“H1350” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}, \w that his name| strong="H8034" \w* [may be famous]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”} \w in Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.\f + \fr 4:14 \ft left…: Heb. caused to cease unto thee \f* \f + \fr 4:14 \ft kinsman: or, redeemer \f* 
\v 15 [And he shall be unto thee a restorer]{strong=“H7725” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8688”} of thy \w life| strong="H5315" \w*, [and a nourisher]{strong=“H3557” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8771”} \w of thine old age| strong="H7872" \w*: \w for thy daughter in law| strong="H3618" \w*, [which loveth]{strong=“H157” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [thee, which is better]{strong=“H2896”} \w to thee than seven| strong="H7651" \w* \w sons| strong="H1121" \w*, [hath born]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} him.\f + \fr 4:15 \ft a nourisher of: Heb. to nourish \f* \f + \fr 4:15 \ft thine…: Heb. thy gray hairs \f* 
\v 16 \w And Naomi| strong="H5281" \w* [took]{strong=“H3947” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w the child| strong="H3206" \w*, [and laid]{strong=“H7896” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w it in her bosom| strong="H2436" \w*, [and became nurse]{strong=“H539” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} unto it. 
\v 17 \w And the women her neighbours| strong="H7934" \w* [gave]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w it a name| strong="H8034" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w There is a son| strong="H1121" \w* [born]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8795”} \w to Naomi| strong="H5281" \w*; [and they called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his name| strong="H8034" \w* \w Obed| strong="H5744" \w*: he is \w the father| strong="H1" \w* \w of Jesse| strong="H3448" \w*, \w the father| strong="H1" \w* \w of David| strong="H1732" \w*. 
\p
